{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109503","id":2733783887,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6i8jtP","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109503","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109503.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109503.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109503","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109503/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109503/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109503/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/df962a4a756272ecbfeebc2fe30d0172478976b3","number":109503,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Make all `AudioStreamPlayer` type `volume_db` sliders cap out at 24dB, add `or_greater`","user":{"login":"RoyBerardo","id":32561682,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTYxNjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32561682?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo","html_url":"https://github.com/RoyBerardo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This makes the `AudioStreamPlayer3D` `volume_db` have an upper limit of 24dB instead of 80dB, bringing it in line with the other stream players.\r\n\r\nThis also adds `or_greater` to all the stream players' `volume_db` sliders.\r\n\r\nClosed https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109454 in favor of this.\r\n\r\nAs mentioned in the above PR, I believe this should be merged alongside (or before) https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109452, so people don't quickly drag up the `AudioStreamPlayer3D` dB volume sliders and explode their ears.\r\n\r\n`or_greater` was originally added to keep compat, in case anyone had their 3D stream player `volume_db` sliders above 24. [It was suggested](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109454#issuecomment-3170652411) that `or_greater` be added to the other stream players, so I created this PR\r\n\r\nEDIT: dang, I realized I named the branch very poorly. I hope that isn't a problem","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"h